      "statement": "SOPS encryption rules encrypt whole `talos/*.sops.yaml` files and only `data`/`stringData` keys for `(bootstrap|kubernetes)/*.sops.yaml` files, both with mac_only_encrypted; Flux Kustomizations decrypt using the sops provider with the `sops-age` secret in flux-system.",
