      "id": "claim_49870cb6422c4b2ebd07aabc4fe4d526",
      "statement": "The manual talos:upgrade-node task resolves the Talos image URL from talos/talconfig.yaml and version from talenv.yaml, runs talhelper gencommand upgrade with a 10m timeout, and preconditions on talosctl connectivity; upgrade-k8s similarly reads kubernetesVersion from talenv.yaml.",
