        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_6afcc18fe183478ba43eb419cc0fcafd",
      "statement": "The cluster Kustomization graph requires the gateway-api-crds (experimental CRDs) and external-dns-crds Kustomizations — each built from its own GitRepository source — to be Ready before cluster-apps reconciles, so CRD-kustomization failures surface as cluster-apps dependency errors.",
