    {
      "id": "claim_7ae451eec9b641628342f2e4c6e26e3a",
      "statement": "TopoLVM provides the default storage class topolvm-thin-provisioner (XFS, Immediate volume binding, expansion allowed, LVM thin pool 'thin') with lvmdEmbedded: true, so a Pending PVC usually means topolvm-node/lvmd unhealthy or thin pool exhaustion on the single node.",
